 morning"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Wa alaikum salam is the response.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "c1417b55-7692-41a2-a893-3e733939f3c2", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The number of angels is known only to:", "options": ["Allah", "Prophets", "Angels", "Humans"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Only Allah knows the number of angels.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "f2503555-c3d9-4c09-811c-c3c65ad257a0", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for paradise is:", "options": ["Jannah", "Jahannam", "Akhirah", "Dunya"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Jannah is paradise in Islam.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "1412a4f8-e787-4dbd-8990-841d9f9db244", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for hell is:", "options": ["Jahannam", "Jannah", "Akhirah", "Dunya"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Jahannam is hell in Islam.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "95425b2e-b5a1-4092-b36c-547a605270f3", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The day of judgement is called:", "options": ["Yaum al-Qiyamah", "Yaum al-Jumuah", "Yaum al-Arafah", "Yaum al-Ashura"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Yaum al-Qiyamah is the day of judgement.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "0768e2b0-c524-461d-9c66-540da47feead", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for faith is:", "options": ["Iman", "Islam", "Ihsan", "Tawhid"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Iman is faith in Islam.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "0c63f2e9-de1c-4683-80fe-f9af6ceaf2f4", "subject_id": "