planation": "Tawhid is divine unity.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "dabbb9d1-88bf-4896-898b-8d3142c9ccff", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for the afterlife is:", "options": ["Akhirah", "Dunya", "Jannah", "Jahannam"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Akhirah is the afterlife.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "630b46ed-7246-40ee-a206-d89501603c8c", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for worldly life is:", "options": ["Dunya", "Akhirah", "Jannah", "Jahannam"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Dunya is worldly life.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "24efe30c-b11e-459c-9de2-cc47bd3d1db1", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for paradise is also called:", "options": ["Al-Jannah", "Al-Firdaws", "Al-Naim", "All of the above"], "correct_answer": 3, "explanation": "All are names for paradise.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "6f9af88b-fff8-4fc5-ab6c-d97804ef5807", "subject_id": "irs", "subject_name": "IRS", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Islamic term for hell is also called:", "options": ["Jahannam", "Laza", "Hutamah", "All of the above"], "correct_answer": 3, "explanation": "All are names for hell.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}]